  <event id="94">
      <start>12:30</start>
      <duration>00:45</duration>
      <room>AW1.105</room>
      <slug></slug>
      <title>Give me a Jingle</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Jabber</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.xmpp.org/extensions/xep-0166.html&#34;&gt;Jingle XEPs&lt;/a&gt; add support to XMPP for session-based features such as voice, video and file transfer.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk will discuss the justification for these extensions, what they are trying to achieve, and how they work, taking a look at the current state of the standards and their implementations.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="941">Robert McQueen</person>
          <person id="942">Peter Saint-Andre</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>